/target
node_modules/
/ui/dist/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-*
*.log
.DS_Store

# Tauri-generated schemas
/crates/gui/gen/

# Documentation policy: no markdown ships unless it is named below.
#
# Default-deny, because the previous default-allow list broke silently. It
# named /PLAN.md and /REVIEW.md; when those files moved under docs/ the rules
# matched nothing, and ~200 KB of internal review material sat one
# `git add -A` away from being published. Under these rules a new internal
# document is ignored the moment it is created, and shipping one is a
# deliberate edit here rather than something you have to remember.
#
# The exceptions are anchored to the repo root, so a markdown file added
# deeper in the tree — a crate-level README, say — is ignored until it is
# named here too.
*.md
!/README.md
!/SECURITY.md

# Internal working documents. Ignored as a directory, so non-markdown notes
# dropped in here are covered as well.
/docs/
